<DIV8 N="780.217" TYPE="SECTION" hierarchy_metadata="{&quot;path&quot;:&quot;/on/_SUBSTITUTE_DATE_/title-29/section-780.217&quot;,&quot;citation&quot;:&quot;29 CFR 780.217&quot;}">
<HEAD>&#xA7; 780.217 Forestry activities.</HEAD>
<P>Operations in a forest tree nursery such as seeding new beds and growing and transplanting forest seedlings are not farming operations. For such operations to fall within sec. 3(f), they must qualify under the second part of the definition dealing with incidental practices. <I>See</I> &#xA7; 780.201.</P>
<CITA TYPE="N">[73 FR 77239, Dec. 18, 2008. Redesignated at 74 FR 26015, May 29, 2009]
</CITA>
<EFFDNOT>
<HED>Effective Date Note:</HED><PSPACE>At 74 FR 26015, May 29, 2009, &#xA7; 780.208 was redesignated as &#xA7; 780.217 and newly designated &#xA7; 780.217 was suspended, effective June 29, 2009.</PSPACE></EFFDNOT>
</DIV8>

